{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116368","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116368/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116368/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116368/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116368","id":3949123251,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7EK5Cf","number":116368,"title":"Fix Tool Script behaviors requiring restart.","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-02-16T18:49:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:06:29Z","closed_at":"2026-09-21T15:07:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116368","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116368","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116368.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116368.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-21T15:07:12Z"},"body":"Primarily authored by @Hilderin, superseding https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92099\r\n\r\n`@tool` Scripts have several commonly reported issues derived from only being soft-reloaded upon modification. \r\n* Adding `@tool` to a script already attached to a node will not add in-editor behavior until restart.\r\n* Modifying an existing tool script to behave differently will not change until restart.\r\n* Modifying an existing tool script's variables will cause a soft-reload that can result in bad memory access, including a crash which I suspect is under-reported.\r\n\r\nThis PR resolves these issues by forcing reloads of a script when `@tool` is added or removed, as well as when any existing tool script is modified. This is only a minor adjustment to the original PR, adding the extra case of forcing reload when a tool script is edited, even if the tool annotation is not added or removed.\r\n\r\n```\r\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\r\n\t\t// If @tool is added/removed, or an existing tool script is changed, we will force a reload.\r\n\t\t// On add/removal, changes placeholder instance to an actual instance or vice versa.\r\n\t\t// On Tool Script change, replaces a stale instance with an up-to-date GDscriptInstance for consistent behavior.\r\n\t\tif (scr->is_tool() || was_tool) {\r\n\t\t\t_prepare_script_for_reload(scr, to_reload[scr]);\r\n\t\t}\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI have rebased onto Master, and tested the fix, it appears to still behave correctly. Based on my testing, this should resolve:\r\n* Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66381\r\n* ~Fixes~ (outdated) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114485 (POSSIBLE CRASH)\r\n* ~Fixes~ (outdated) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115187\r\n* Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103591\r\n\r\n* _Maintainer edit: Supersedes and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92099_\r\n\r\n\r\nShould also revert the Docs warning about Issue #66381 : https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/10544","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116368/reactions","total_count":37,"+1":22,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":8,"rocket":0,"eyes":7},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116368/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}